    "body": "This is probably a dumb question since I'm not a microarchitect, but could we do the authorization prior to the LSU and potentially insert stalls to ensure a non-speculative PCC is available?\n\nIf this is too awkward and introduces significant complexity for the uarch I am fine with it being optional.\n\nWould like to see another LGTM from others (e.g. @jrtc27 @nwf @davidchisnall) that we are okay with this new approach before merging.",
